-int main() {
-    // Set firmware image path for debugging
-    sddc_set_firmware_path("C:/Users/ryzerth/Downloads/SDDC_FX3 (1).img");
+// FIXED: this tool had two upstream defects that made it unusable on any machine
+// other than the original author's:
+//   1. It hardcoded the firmware image path to "C:/Users/ryzerth/Downloads/SDDC_FX3 (1).img",
+//      so an RX888 sitting in FX3 bootloader mode could never be brought up.
+//   2. It hardcoded the device serial number "0009072C00C40C32", so it would fail on
+//      every other unit even after the firmware had loaded.
+// It was also an infinite loop that reported the *error code* as a sample count.
